{"4938790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gallery Organizer", "steam_appid": 4938790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5122790], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery Organizer is a relaxing sim where you curate an art gallery featuring works by real artists. Whether you choose a Local Exhibition with just 100 paintings, a massive World Expo showcasing up to 1,000 artworks, or anything in between, every gallery is uniquely yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classify and Hang</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your art knowledge and intuition to classify paintings into their correct themed exhibition rooms. Then arrange them freely within each space to create your own exhibition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/071a42420606156258311bd1b4ac0bd3.poster.avif?t=1788258843\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/071a42420606156258311bd1b4ac0bd3.webm?t=1788258843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/071a42420606156258311bd1b4ac0bd3.mp4?t=1788258843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/e4ae9698ac0ae9a8065946d7f71e244f.avif?t=1788258843\" width=1170 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Empower Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover handy tools that help you work smarter and focus on creating the perfect exhibition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/a00d586be92f2d86e6deceb842a31a58.poster.avif?t=1788258843\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/a00d586be92f2d86e6deceb842a31a58.webm?t=1788258843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/a00d586be92f2d86e6deceb842a31a58.mp4?t=1788258843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/e4ae9698ac0ae9a8065946d7f71e244f.avif?t=1788258843\" width=1170 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Your Gallery, Your Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated galleries ensure that every exhibition is different. Adjust the size of your gallery, set the difficulty level, and enjoy a fresh challenge every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/7b90dc3cfe7792741e75d1dcfbeb78fb.poster.avif?t=1788258843\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/7b90dc3cfe7792741e75d1dcfbeb78fb.webm?t=1788258843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/7b90dc3cfe7792741e75d1dcfbeb78fb.mp4?t=1788258843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/e4ae9698ac0ae9a8065946d7f71e244f.avif?t=1788258843\" width=1170 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slow Down and Enjoy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time, admire beautiful artworks, relax to soothing music, and watch an empty gallery transform into an exhibition you'll be proud of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/4558c289af2edf7bd1df4b26dc365337.poster.avif?t=1788258843\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/4558c289af2edf7bd1df4b26dc365337.webm?t=1788258843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/4558c289af2edf7bd1df4b26dc365337.mp4?t=1788258843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience paintings by real artists, sourced from royalty-free collections &amp; generously donated by their owners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize procedurally generated galleries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy relaxing gameplay with no time pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own hand-picked art collections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay with customizable gallery sizes and difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of soundtracks.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery Organizer is a relaxing sim where you curate an art gallery featuring works by real artists. Whether you choose a Local Exhibition with just 100 paintings, a massive World Expo showcasing up to 1,000 artworks, or anything in between, every gallery is uniquely yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classify and Hang</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your art knowledge and intuition to classify paintings into their correct themed exhibition rooms. Then arrange them freely within each space to create your own exhibition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/071a42420606156258311bd1b4ac0bd3.poster.avif?t=1788258843\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/071a42420606156258311bd1b4ac0bd3.webm?t=1788258843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/071a42420606156258311bd1b4ac0bd3.mp4?t=1788258843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/e4ae9698ac0ae9a8065946d7f71e244f.avif?t=1788258843\" width=1170 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Empower Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover handy tools that help you work smarter and focus on creating the perfect exhibition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938790/extras/a00d586be92f2d86e6deceb842a31a58.poster.avif?t=1788258843\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst